  "system": {
    "description": "<p>A cyclone hurtles towards your enemies, blasting them away.</p><p>Choose a direction for a <strong>5-space-cone</strong>, starting at the edge of your space.</p><p>Each creature within the cone takes <strong>1</strong> <strong>Damage</strong> as they are blasted back.</p><p>Additionally, each affected creature must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be pushed <strong>5 spaces</strong> away.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the distance of the push by <strong>+1</strong> space per extra success.</p>",
